Observation-only: trace completions of ISO transfers whose ring was released
while inflight (usb_host_iso_orphan_callback, with the transfer pointer that
pairs it to its usb_host_iso_submit record and the same packet summary as
usb_host_iso_callback). No transport or timing behaviour change is intended.
Apply AFTER qemu-iso.patch, qemu-poll.patch and qemu-wait.patch to official
QEMU v11.1.0 commit 84f07211cc5b4fc6a371559bf8a5de4fb068e648.
The emulator as a whole remains GPL-2.0-or-later. host-libusb.c keeps its
original upstream notice:
